# Bots and AI

Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M2 Vertical slice
Dependencies: `03_PLAYER_CAMERA_INPUT.todo`, `04_TERRITORY_PAINTING.todo`, `06_MATCH_FLOW_SCORING.todo`

## Purpose

Provide a fair, seedable opponent that demonstrates the game loop without hidden stat advantages.

## Tasks

- [ ] Define bot intent interface shared with human input.
- [ ] Implement valid movement target selection.
- [ ] Implement route painting behavior.
- [ ] Implement contested-territory selection.
- [ ] Implement basic opponent awareness.
- [ ] Implement spray resource awareness.
- [ ] Implement active-arena awareness.
- [ ] Implement stuck detection and recovery.
- [ ] Inject deterministic random source.
- [ ] Add debug state overlay.
- [ ] Add full-match bot test.
- [ ] Record first bot profile tuning.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Bot uses the same movement, spray, and status rules as a human.
- [ ] Fixed seed reproduces bot decisions.
- [ ] Bot completes ten matches without leaving the arena or permanent stuck state.
- [ ] Bot does not spray continuously when recovery is required.
- [ ] Difficulty does not use hidden movement or paint multipliers.

